  "content": [
    {
      "text": "card: where the host draws Keel cards, the user sees what follows as a card carrying its name, links and ids, so a reply can call it by name; the ids and links here serve tool calls and hosts without cards.\n\nCheck a strategy · Momentum rotation v3 · version 1 · Running · 9 of 26 runs\nDays Mar 23, 2025 to Oct 29, 2026, split Apr 17, 2026 · 100 coins: the coins Momentum rotation trades · costs 9 bp a fill · data as of Oct 29, 2026\nkeel_research_get(study_id=\"stu_000008\") reads it as it fills in.\nRuns: 9 runs, 0 reused, 17 not run\nCharts (13): Your checks · Growth of 1 · Before and after the split · Sharpe as costs rise · Sharpe when trading late · Sharpe on the top coins · Sharpe without the best coins · 150 random books · A year ahead, resampled · Re-picking the settings · Where the return came from · Up and down markets · How it moves with what you run. keel_research_get(study_id=\"stu_000008\", view=0) reads the numbers behind any of them.\nMeasured with the backtest, costs from none to six times, trading 1 to 3 days late and 10 more checks.\nMomentum rotation v3 has a newer version, v4. Plan it in the app: keel_app_link(id=\"stu_000008\")\nView in Keel: https://app.usekeel.io/research/stu_000008",
      "type": "text"
    }
